OL,3,AMonzo says issue with card payments and
OL,4,Atransfers now resolved
OL,5,
OL,6,FMonzo says a technical issue which left
OL,7,Fusers unable to use their card for
OL,8,Fpayments or transfers has now been
OL,9,Fresolved.
OL,11,FThe digital bank had previously posted
OL,12,Fon X, external it had "identified some
OL,13,Fissues" and activated a stand-in backup
OL,14,Fservice which meant users could still
OL,15,Fmake transactions like card payments
OL,16,Fand sending and receiving bank
OL,17,Ftransfers.
OL,19,FHowever, some users noted under the
OL,20,Fpost, external that Monzo Stand-in was
OL,21,F"not working as expected" and they
OL,22,Fcould still not use their card.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,112,105,200,160,0,100
