OL,3,AMonzo says issue with card payments and
OL,4,Atransfers now resolved
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing this, a Monzo spokesperson
OL,7,Fsaid all of its services were now "back
OL,8,Fup and running".  "We're sorry for any
OL,9,Finconvenience and thank customers for
OL,10,Ftheir patience," they said.
